  "status": "draft",
  "notes": [
    "One flag per gym is both the badge ledger entry and the unlock for that town's waystone (docs/world-building/NAVIGATION.md).",
    "Badges themselves are items given by each leader's RCT loot table on first defeat; the flag records the defeat, it does not give the badge.",
    "Leader order is Cobbleverse's RCT requiredDefeats chain per series, read from COBBLEVERSE-RCT-DP-v20. Which leader sits in which town is a trainer-design decision still open.",
    "Level caps are computed by RCT per player from the active series (initialLevelCap 20, relativeLevelCap 5 in config), so chapters carry no level_cap here.",
    "Waystone positions are null until town locations are placed after the next terrain rendition."
  ],
